# Real O2 @main fill-loop occupancy-miss: SET Prefer=$r3 is a body read,
# unmentioned FA cluster r4–r12 (SP+off dests Exit reads), tail-imm
# r14=ADDI r0,22. r3 is PreferHasBodyUse, not FA. XOR / PEI dest r7 hid
# the miss (lit-green LatchScr=$r7). Last-resort LatchScr=R0, SET gone,
# never MOVE32/COPY/SUBI/LD32/S_LW/BNEZ of Prefer / r3 / r4–r12 / r14,
# never LatchScr=$r7/Prefer/r3/r14. A CHECK-NOT of only r3/r4/r7/r14 lets
# a live-through steal of r5–r6/r8–r12 hide (PEI lowers latch LD32 to S_LW).
