  ; loop header redefines r14 from that copy dest. Live-into-exit of r14
  ; dies on the header def; a post-SET ADDI32_W-only pin stays green.
  ; Copy-chain flood skips r3, r4, and r14. r5–r12 are mentioned so
  ; pass-2 cannot steal them. Occupancy miss fatals rather than
  ; MOVE32/SUBI/LD32/BNEZ of those GPRs or LatchScr=Prefer.
